    "https://www.husson.edu/student-success/career-services/index.html": {
      "title": "Career Services",
      "description": "Career Services Skip to Top Navigation Skip to Content Skip to Footer Eagle Connect Alumni Families APPLY GIVE Academics Admissions & Aid Online Programs Visit Close Search Are you looking for? Accepted Student Day Athletics Bookstore Calendar Canvas Commencement Course Offerings Directory Employment Housing Husson Supports Library Map Mental Health Resources Open House Registrar Student Accounts Student Employment Welcome Weekend Close Academics Programs View All Undergraduate Graduate/Professional Certificates Online Schools & Colleges College of Business College of Health and Professional Studies College of Science & Humanities New England School of Communications School of Online and Professional Studies Admissions & Aid Undergraduate Students Transfer Students Graduate Students International Initiatives Online Students Tuition & Costs Financial Aid Plan a Visit Apply Now Student Life Career Services Center for Student Success Dining Services Esports Husson Gear Residence Life Safety and Security Wellness Center About Accreditation 2023 NECHE Self-Study Consumer Information Distinguished Business Speaker Series Institute for Strategic Leadership and Workforce Development Partnerships Athletics Eagle Intranet Online Programs Apply Give Canvas Bookstore Nest Eagle Connect Calendar Map Contact Us Directory Library News Resources For Alumni Family Current Students Faculty & Staff Search Menu Career Services For Students For Employers For Faculty and Staff Home Career Services Mission and Vision: The Career Services team is responsible for helping students bridge the gap between academia and joining the workforce in their desired field of study. Appointments are available either in-person or via Google Meet. To schedule an appointment with one of our advisors, please contact us by email. careerservices@husson.edu Upcoming Events Career Services will email its list of active employers every August and January regarding upcoming events for the Fall and Spring semesters. If you would like to be included in the email list, please contact CareerServices@husson.edu . Join Us On LinkedIn Explore the unique career paths of Husson Alumni and discover how a Husson education can be the catalyst for incredible journeys. Listen Now Back to Top Husson University | 1 College Circle | Bangor, Maine | 04401-2929 207.941.7000 | admit@husson.edu | Facebook YouTube LinkedIn Instagram Flickr Careers Board of Trustees Safety & Security Non-Discrimination Policy Privacy Policy Accessibility Copyright © Husson University, 1997-2026"
    },
    "https://www.husson.edu/academics/registrar/faculty-staff-logins.html": {
      "title": "Faculty/Staff Logins",
      "description": "Faculty/Staff Logins Skip to Top Navigation Skip to Content Skip to Footer Eagle Connect Alumni Families APPLY GIVE Academics Admissions & Aid Online Programs Visit Close Search Are you looking for? Accepted Student Day Athletics Bookstore Calendar Canvas Commencement Course Offerings Directory Employment Housing Husson Supports Library Map Mental Health Resources Open House Registrar Student Accounts Student Employment Welcome Weekend Close Academics Programs View All Undergraduate Graduate/Professional Certificates Online Schools & Colleges College of Business College of Health and Professional Studies College of Science & Humanities New England School of Communications School of Online and Professional Studies Admissions & Aid Undergraduate Students Transfer Students Graduate Students International Initiatives Online Students Tuition & Costs Financial Aid Plan a Visit Apply Now Student Life Career Services Center for Student Success Dining Services Esports Husson Gear Residence Life Safety and Security Wellness Center About Accreditation 2023 NECHE Self-Study Consumer Information Distinguished Business Speaker Series Institute for Strategic Leadership and Workforce Development Partnerships Athletics Eagle Intranet Online Programs Apply Give Canvas Bookstore Nest Eagle Connect Calendar Map Contact Us Directory Library News Resources For Alumni Family Current Students Faculty & Staff Search Menu Faculty/Staff Logins Home Academics Office of the Registrar Faculty/Staff Logins Registrar Registrar Catalog Course Offerings Faculty/Staff Logins Privacy & Confidentiality (FERPA) Student Complaint Policy Student Logins Transcript Request Transfer Agreements Bookstore Account and Technology Information For answers to questions about your Husson University accounts, you can contact the Information Technology Department by dialing (207) 973-1000 and Toll-Free at (866) 416-7488, or emailing us at HelpDesk@Husson.edu (please note: for security reasons, password reset assistance is best addressed over the phone) Please note that, by signing into your Husson University Gmail or network accounts, you acknowledge that you have read and will adhere to the provisions of the Husson University policy on computer use. Before accessing any of these accounts, please review the Husson University Technology Standards and Policies documentation: http://www.husson.edu/technology-standards-and-procedures NEW EMPLOYEES PLEASE NOTE: New employees will receive notification of their Husson University account information and initial login steps to the email they provided on their application.  Before logging into the Network (on-campus) or Gmail (off-campus), you will need to visit pwchange.husson.edu to access your account and create a personal password. ~Thank you, The IT Department Information Technology Department Hours of Operation: Semester Hours EST: Monday - Friday: 7:30 a.m. - 5:00 p.m. Call Center Hours: Monday - Friday: 7:30 a.m. - 5:00 p.m. Important Password Information Password management for the Husson Network account (including Husson computers, Canvas, Eagle Card, and Google accounts) will be handled by the pwchange.husson.edu site.  This site allows you to clear lockouts, manually reset, or decide to change your password at any time! To manage your password use pwchange.husson.edu and log in or use Self-Service Options to change your password.  Once you've successfully changed the password on this page, it will also change the password for the following accounts: Network Account (Computer Labs, Library computers) Gmail/Google Apps Account ( name@husson.edu ) Canvas Account Eagle Card HU Wifi on personal devices **For students this also includes Math Placement & Housing application If you do not know your Network/Google ID or password, please contact the Information Technology Help Desk at (207) 973-1000 for assistance. NOTE: CAMS Faculty Portal ( eFaculty.husson.edu ) accounts are a stand-alone account and have to be reset manually OTHER: You can learn more about Google Apps for Education here: http://www.google.com/apps/intl/en/edu/university.html ADDITIONAL LOGIN INFORMATION Network Accounts The network account allows you to log into Husson-managed computers, this includes hardware assigned to faculty/staff, computer labs, and library computers on campus. HU Wifi on personal laptops or phones when on campus. The network account name is made up of your last name and first initial (in some cases it may be more than the first initial) Example ID: JonesD or JonesDo Passwords are managed via the pwchange.husson.edu site Any issues accessing this site can be directed to the Information Technology Department for assistance Canvas Canvas by Instructure is Husson's Learning Management System for all classes, another way to think of it is an online interactive classroom As an instructor, you can receive assistance with Canvas in different ways Login troubles - Contact the Information Technology Department Customization or programming of classes - Instructional Technology Canvas Site: https://husson.instructure.com Account Credentials The account name and password will be the same as the Husson Gmail account and password For more information about computer requirements for Canvas, please follow this link. Gmail/Google Apps Account Your Google Apps Account includes email (Gmail), drive, calendar, and other helpful applications. It is critical that you access your Google Apps Account and read your email regularly. All notifications, all communications between you and your students, other faculty, admissions, student accounts, university security, and Information Technology, will be sent to you through this official university email. Account Credentials Email will be last name first initial(s) with the extension of @husson.edu Example: smithj@husson.edu The account password will be the same as the network account and managed by PWChange.husson.edu CAMS/Portal Account CAMS is the faculty database. This account is sometimes called the Faculty Portal and allows you to view schedules and room assignments, submit roster discrepancy reports, and submit midterm and final grades. PLEASE NOTE: This password is NOT linked to the Network Account CAMS Site: efaculty.husson.edu Account Credentials The account name will be LastnameFirstInitial(s) Password is set independently of Network account - to reset this password select the \"Forgot Password\" link under the Login button. Back to Top Husson University | 1 College Circle | Bangor, Maine | 04401-2929 207.941.7000 | admit@husson.edu | Facebook YouTube LinkedIn Instagram Flickr Careers Board of Trustees Safety & Security Non-Discrimination Policy Privacy Policy Accessibility Copyright © Husson University, 1997-2026"
    },
