 ancestry or national origin, genetic information or other status protected by law. This policy applies to promotions, training, compensation and all other conditions related to employment. The University will make reasonable accommodations for qualified individuals in accordance with applicable law. View Employment Positions Back to Top Husson University | 1 College Circle | Bangor, Maine | 04401-2929 207.941.7000 | admit@husson.edu | Facebook YouTube LinkedIn Instagram Flickr Careers Board of Trustees Safety & Security Non-Discrimination Policy Privacy Policy Accessibility Copyright © Husson University, 1997-2026"
